100 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 80 0 R
/E (PROMETHEUS IGNIS integrates official records from IDEAM \(covering up to 90 days\) with satellite data from NASA FIRMS \(covering 7 days\) on its server. For the latter, it distinguishes between data from the VIIRS \(~375 m\) and MODIS \(~1 km\) sensors. The platform also supports local CSV files, a demonstration mode, and live weather data from Open-Meteo. It standardizes coordinates, timestamps, confidence levels, and Fire Radiative Power \(FRP\) values; removes duplicates; infers locations; and calculates a recurrence index along with FRP statistics. The results can be viewed via the Map, the Analytics section, a calendar broken down by subregions of Antioquia, AI-generated summaries \(via Gemini\), and downloadable PDF reports.)
/Pg 11 0 R
/K [5]
>>
endobj
